        "Application Area：",
        "Applied for auxiliary shaft hoisting in mines, for transporting personnel, ores, equipment and materials. For medium‑size and small‑size mines, the cage can also serve as main‑shaft hoisting equipment for coal lifting. It is one of the key pieces of mine hoisting equipment.",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
